# Dark Samus SweepBeam: Sanctuary 10_cliff_rooftop layer 2 (MP2_WORLD="1baa96c2,10_cliff_rooftop"
# MP2_INPUT="LAYER2@400"), boss u04f7. The beam's effect starts at the kUE_BeginAction event of
# the sweep animation and stops at kUE_EndAction; the second pass stands the boss 8 units from
# the player so a damage ray finds the player.
@f600 send u04f7 Activate
@f700 fsm u04f7 SweepBeam
@f1000 obj u04f7
@f1100 place u04f7 player 8
@f1110 fsm u04f7 SweepBeam
@f1400 obj u04f7
@f1500 place u04f7 player 5
@f1510 fsm u04f7 SweepBeam
@f1800 obj u04f7
